<title>USA: Gilman&amp;Ciocia oks buyback up to 75,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Gilman&amp;Ciocia oks buyback up to 75,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gilman &amp; Ciocia Inc said Tuesday it authorized the repurchase of up to 75,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The timing and price of these purchases will be subject to market conditions.</p>
<p>Gilman &amp; Ciocia is a financial planning and tax preperation company.</p>
</text>
